h paper for class. It's a 2000 word essay and  I'm running out of time.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You look stressed out.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le10ob08re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Between work and school, I'm  being stretched too thin.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You need to look after yourself. I felt the same way at cooking school sometimes.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, and you weren't working at the same time. English essays require so much work!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Want some advice?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sure.", "id": 2, "time": "11500", "image": "engenn5le10ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Take a walk in the park and clear your head. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Alright.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Then, go home and have a hot shower. It will help you relax.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ok, do you know how to write a great essay?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I have a lot of resources on my computer. When I get home, I'll e-mail you the information.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That sounds great! I really appreciate it.", "id": 3, "time": "29500", "image": "engenn5le10ob08re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le10ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le10ob08re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "Learn how to write an essay.", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn5le10ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}